Flag: EXEMPT Bugfix
Test: manually verified
(cherry picked from https://googleplex-android-review.googlesource.com/q/commit:c8123b01bc9c0a3799320342f0319e9b637a5f0d)
Merged-In: I915b1ffa30418bdb5df553057680e44b1b18af06
